# Environment Configuration
#
# This is a monorepo. Each application has its own .env file.
#
# Please copy and configure the .env files in each application directory:
#
# - API: apps/api/.env (copy from apps/api/.env.example)
# - Web: No .env needed (uses default localhost:4000 API URL)
# - Agents: agents/.env (copy from agents/.env.example if using agents)
#
# See individual .env.example files for required configuration.
